    { "type": "text", "id": "subtitle", "x": 60, "y": 68, "width": 1500, "height": 40,
      "text": "The Frameworks ERP lives on the office LAN and is unreachable from the internet. Everything below is the machinery that gets a Shopify order to it — and the side-effects that fan out on the way.",
