      "text": "sof-api   [ TARGET ]\nNestJS + Prisma + JWT\n\nwebhooks · order queue / drain\ncontribution + GP alert\nmetrics · jobs · users\nb2b-sync status · inventory relay\n\nparity with sof-main: WIP", "originalText": "sof-api   [ TARGET ]\nNestJS + Prisma + JWT\n\nwebhooks · order queue / drain\ncontribution + GP alert\nmetrics · jobs · users\nb2b-sync status · inventory relay\n\nparity with sof-main: WIP",
